            <p>We present relevant opportunities that align with mandate, structure, and current project availability.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="timeline-hybrid-card">
            <div class="timeline-hybrid-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3 5 6v6c0 4.5 3 7.5 7 9 4-1.5 7-4.5 7-9V6l-7-3Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="timeline-hybrid-label">Step 04</p>
            <h3>KYC &amp; Compliance</h3>
            <p>All onboarding, documentation, and compliance checks are completed before any capital commitment is made.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="timeline-hybrid-card">
            <div class="timeline-hybrid-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 16.5 10 10.5l3.5 3.5L20 7.5"></path><path d="M14 7.5h6v6"></path><path d="M5 19.5h14"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <p class="timeline-hybrid-label">Step 05</p>
            <h3>Capital Deployment</h3>
            <p>Once cleared, capital is deployed into the selected opportunity and execution begins under the agreed structure.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-hybrid-cta">
          <a class="button" href="#">Contact our Team</a>
        </div>
      </div>
</section>

    {homepageSuggestedPosts.length > 0 && (
      <section class="section home-suggested-reads">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-header">
            <p class="eyebrow">Suggested Reads</p>
            <h2>Continue exploring the Andorran market.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="home-suggested-grid">
            {homepageSuggestedPosts.map((entry) => (
              <article class="home-suggested-card">
                <a class="home-suggested-link" href={`/blog/${entry.slug}`}>
                  <img src={entry.image} alt={entry.title} loading="lazy" />
                  <div class="home-suggested-meta">
                    <div class="home-suggested-metrics">
                      <span class="home-suggested-pill">{entry.date}</span>
                      <span class="home-suggested-pill">{entry.category}</span>
                    </div>
                    <h3>{entry.title}</h3>
                    <p class="home-suggested-excerpt">{entry.excerpt}</p>
                  </div>
                </a>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
          <a class="cta-link" href="/blog">See more insights</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    )}

    <section class="section newsletter" id="newsletter">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Newsletter</p>
        <div class="newsletter-wrap">
          <div class="newsletter-copy">
            <h2>Stay informed on Andorra opportunities.</h2>
            <p>Get concise updates on market shifts, pipeline milestones, and investor-relevant developments.</p>
          </div>
          <form
            class="newsletter-form"
            name="newsletter-signup"
            data-netlify="true"
            action="#"
            method="post"
          >
            <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="newsletter-signup" />
            <label class="sr-only" for="newsletter-email">Email address</label>
            <input
              class="newsletter-input"
              id="newsletter-email"
              name="email"
              type="email"
              placeholder="Enter your email"
              required
            />
            <button class="newsletter-button" type="submit">Subscribe</button>
          </form>
        </div>
        <p class="newsletter-note">We send selective updates only. No spam.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <SiteFooter />
    <script type="module">
      const root = document.body;
      const syncHeaderState = () => {
        root.classList.toggle("is-scrolled", window.scrollY > 10);
      };

      syncHeaderState();
      window.addEventListener("scroll", syncHeaderState, { passive: true });
    </script>

  </body>
</html>
